              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jo Ciria gua woko ki bote, gubwoto en ma doŋ guketo ret marac twatwal i kome, Luticce gupiro lok i kome pi culo kwor pi remo pa wod pa ajwaka Yekoyada, ci guneke woko i ot i wi kitandane. En oto kit meno, ci giyike i gaŋ kal pa Daudi, ento pe giyiko en i Lyel pa luker, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo ma gujemo i kome gin ene: Jabad wod pa Cimeat ma nya jo Ammon, ki Yekojabad wod pa Cimrit ma nya jo Moab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
